{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794768514","published":"2026-11-15T18:48:57Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:29.614805668Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-116304","CVE-2026-116306","CVE-2026-116307","CVE-2026-116309","CVE-2026-116314","CVE-2026-116315","CVE-2026-116316","CVE-2026-116317","CVE-2026-116319","CVE-2026-116320","CVE-2026-116323","CVE-2026-116326","CVE-2026-116330","CVE-2026-116331","CVE-2026-116332","CVE-2026-116335","CVE-2026-116336","CVE-2026-120139","CVE-2026-120141","CVE-2026-120143","CVE-2026-120145","CVE-2026-120147","CVE-2026-120150","CVE-2026-120151","CVE-2026-120153","CVE-2026-18447","CVE-2026-6460","CVE-2026-6467"],"summary":"postgresql: Fix of 28 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2026-6467: block ALTER SCHEMA RENAME and temporary schema attacks on\n  CREATE EXTENSION\n- CVE-2026-18447: reject pseudo-type output parameters in SQL functions\n- CVE-2026-116304: fix use-after-free in shared tupledesc management\n- CVE-2026-116306: fix composite type changes in ExecEvalFieldStore\n- CVE-2026-116307: PL/Perl: do not free a prepared query while it is being\n  executed\n- CVE-2026-116309: PL/Perl: fix type confusion in get_perl_array_ref()\n- CVE-2026-116314: pg_restore: fix out-of-bounds access and path traversal\n  with crafted archives\n- CVE-2026-116315: fix buffer overrun in tsvector_delete()\n- CVE-2026-116316: prevent restricted code from creating types in pg_temp\n- CVE-2026-116317: fix buffer overrun in ts_rank_cd()\n- CVE-2026-116319: PL/Perl: do not reuse a freed temporary context in\n  return_next()\n- CVE-2026-116320: PL/Perl: fix use-after-free while scanning an array or hash\n- CVE-2026-116323: PL/Tcl: fix use-after-free in re-entrant calls\n- CVE-2026-116326: PL/Perl: fix misbehaviour with tied and magical Perl\n  objects\n- CVE-2026-116330: pg_dump: honor \\restrict keys in the tar format restore.sql\n- CVE-2026-116331: do not use MinMaxAggPath with mismatched aggregate types\n- CVE-2026-116332: fix use-after-free when portals being set up are dropped\n- CVE-2026-116335: reject commutator/negator operators with another result\n  type\n- CVE-2026-116336: fix crash in REINDEX CONCURRENTLY from DDL in index\n  functions\n- CVE-2026-120139: fix tuple size miscalculation via int32 overflow\n- CVE-2026-120141: fix type confusion with materialized set-returning\n  functions\n- CVE-2026-120143: close portals depending on trigger transition tables at\n  SPI_finish\n- CVE-2026-120145: reject system catalogs as logical replication targets\n- CVE-2026-120147: dblink: reject re-entrant use of a connection\n- CVE-2026-120150: fix dangling pointer in expanded-record domain checks\n- CVE-2026-120151: PL/pgSQL: recheck record field type after cast\n- CVE-2026-120153: reject unsafe names in extension script substitutions\n- CVE-2026-6460: forbid ALTERing a column or composite type used by stored\n  expressions, defaults, constraints or indexes; fix related locking races\n  (partial mitigation)\n- Add BuildRequires: perl(FindBin), needed by genbki.pl","affected":[{"package":{"name":"postgresql","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.11-1.el9_2.tuxcare.els24"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1794768514.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-contrib","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql-contrib?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.11-1.el9_2.tuxcare.els24"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1794768514.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-docs","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql-docs?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.11-1.el9_2.tuxcare.e